error[DS0150]: a pipeline starts with `from`
  --> query:1:9
  |
1 | let a = orders | where amount > 1;
  |         ^^^^^^ this table needs `from` before it
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from orders`

error[DS0150]: a pipeline starts with `from`
  --> query:2:9
  |
2 | let b = 'orders.csv' | take 1;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^ this table needs `from` before it
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from 'orders.csv'`

error[DS0150]: a pipeline starts with `from`
  --> query:3:9
  |
