error[DS0150]: a pipeline starts with `from`
  --> query:4:9
  |
4 | let r = read_csv('x.txt');
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ read this table with `from`
  |
  = help: insert `from`: `from read_csv('x.txt')`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    let a = from orders | where amount > 1;
    let b = from 'orders.csv' | take 1;
    let c = from read_csv('x.txt') | take 1;
    let r = from read_csv('x.txt');
    from a | union b, c, r
which parses without errors
